      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("With the battle of Tath over, Kalenz and Landar knew the time had come to carry out Crelanu’s dangerous but necessary plan. Meanwhile Cleodil had, reluctantly, been training Kalenz in a selected few of the secrets of Crelanu’s book..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_21",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/cleodil.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I have taught you all that I dare. My lord... Kalenz... I pray you come back safely. My heart aches when I think of you going into such danger as this. It is peril not merely to your body, but to the essence of yourself."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_22",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Cleodil..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_23",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/cleodil.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I do not think I could bear your death. Still less could I bear the corruption of your soul; the grief would ruin me."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_24",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My eyes are open. To the danger, and... to you. You glow like a star in the night, Cleodil. You will be my guide out of darkness."),
          },
        ],
      },
